{"title":"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The three-digit number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/4/524d57fbda43ad10364003d5f5163ad9b593a8a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a3$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> is added to the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/4/c6411d1cb485e23505a6e11e3469785e152c0955.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$326$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> to give the three-digit number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/7/647bcd01f7548821737c40709ed3c92387dbf18f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5b9$\" width=\"25\" height=\"12\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/7/647bcd01f7548821737c40709ed3c92387dbf18f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5b9$\" width=\"25\" height=\"12\" /> is divisible by 9, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/3/d530a50c2a4650fb0917e20da14bfc764f23dce0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 2\\qquad\\text{(B)}\\ 4\\qquad\\text{(C)}\\ 6\\qquad\\text{(D)}\\ 8\\qquad\\text{(E)}\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"330\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/7/647bcd01f7548821737c40709ed3c92387dbf18f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5b9$\" width=\"25\" height=\"12\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, this must mean that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/5/7150fd82028418423d3db6ac9e0d424e01f2b252.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + b + 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"14\" /> is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/8/4785a254d10556d1eae2e3ec76a6b3edfdc16c96.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5 + b + 9 = 9, 18, 27, 36...\\]\" width=\"195\" height=\"16\" /> \n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/6/216b57cb8cf3a6cb1f578c46640f1171d65b773c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 9 = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is in between 0 and 9, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/a/44a4ada9bd957ecac4eb757fac10c0c7639812d4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5 + b + 9 = 18\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/f/33fa38245981796e3ab9a298c52f19d715a67063.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b = 4\\]\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>The question states that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/8/fc8404f557636ce3531347d952337b0584f11a99.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2a3 + 326 = 549\\]\" width=\"127\" height=\"14\" />\nso \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/0/d801b83455ad4b7b32cad4b8b2af89d0d4a31b7a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2a3 = 549 - 326\\]\" width=\"127\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/8/9682e85d88949832de4fd2a1d9f9c36260b304d0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2a3 = 223\\]\" width=\"78\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/4/49458728d8d83d17c52948f743474ea3d1c5ff13.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a = 2\\]\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/f/d0f5720eed9b5cccaa49671d1b0292d8bf3f4e30.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a + b = 6\\]\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />\nwhich is answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME\" title=\"1967 AHSME\">1967 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1967 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1967\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\